 middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 29% of normal in November to December and 173% in July to August. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 20% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 24430 had its driest year in 1955 at 56%.</p>"}
